Author: Francesco Monti-source [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Francesco Monti-source <58150610+FrancescoMonti-source@users.noreply.github.com>
Description: Retrieves and normalizes EDSAN health data warehouse modules for
    downstream analysis. The package records module-level source contracts,
    batches live API calls, and prepares PMSI and biology/virology payloads into stable
    analysis tables while preserving native identifiers. Document text can be
    normalized with auditable removal of configured administrative and pasted
    laboratory spans.
